===== Q3 (2026-10-13 21:21:04 EDT) =====
question: How does Stitch's library learning differ from DreamCoder's?
command:  python navigator.py --no-cache "How does Stitch's library learning differ from DreamCoder's?"

Loading existing vector DB from chroma_db/
